### ========================================
### CONTACTS API - LOCAL CRUD TEST
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### 1 - GET ALL CONTACTS
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts


### 2 - CREATE CONTACT
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Daniel",
  "lastName": "Mendes",
  "email": "daniel.mendes@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Orange",
  "birthday": "1999-06-20"
}


### 3 - GET CREATED CONTACT
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/6aa2fd45cdc7c9ce5b086ed0


### 4 - UPDATE CREATED CONTACT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/6aa2fd45cdc7c9ce5b086ed0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Daniel",
  "lastName": "Mendes Updated",
  "email": "daniel.updated@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Black",
  "birthday": "1999-06-20"
}


### 5 - GET UPDATED CONTACT
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/6aa2fd45cdc7c9ce5b086ed0


### 6 - DELETE CONTACT
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/6aa2fd45cdc7c9ce5b086ed0


### 7 - CONFIRM CONTACT WAS DELETED
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/6aa2fd45cdc7c9ce5b086ed0